From 1dbc4137709212d37223c89dda8bae0cc0c98527 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taimoor Ul Islam <tislam@iastate.edu>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 12:50:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 02/54] Mark AraSDR/AraRACH environment contributions with
 inline comments

Wrap each AraSDR/AraRACH RF/TDD adaptation region with
'// >>> AraSDR/AraRACH contribution (begin/end)' markers so the provenance
of the env-baseline changes is visible in-tree (complementing the prior
faithful-capture commit and the tracking file in the kaiair repo). Comments
only, no functional change.
